Third-party notices
====================

llama.cpp / ggml
-----------------
Retrograd vendors, as a git submodule, a dedicated fork of llama.cpp
(https://github.com/tterrasson/llama.cpp-retrograd), itself forked from
upstream llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), which bundles
ggml (https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml). Both llama.cpp and ggml are
distributed under the MIT License:

  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The llama.cpp authors

Provenance, the pinned commit, and the fork's own delta list are documented in
crates/retrograd-ffi/runtime/third_party_notes/LLAMA_CPP_SOURCE.md. The full
upstream license text ships with the submodule at
crates/retrograd-ffi/runtime/vendor/llama.cpp/LICENSE once it is checked out
(`scripts/setup-llama-cpp.sh`), and is not duplicated here because the
submodule is not part of this repository's own tracked history.

