Model weights
-------------
No model weights are distributed with Retrograd. scripts/fetch-cpu-fixture.sh
downloads the LFM2.5-230M GGUF (https://huggingface.co/unsloth/LFM2.5-230M-GGUF)
on demand for the CPU test lanes; that file is subject to the LFM Open License
v1.0.
